# log_shore: a log lying at the water's edge, at Deer Lake's outlet
# (BUILD_PLAN S5 brief B5): a bark (10) log, a sage (14) highlight along its
# sunlit top, its sawn end ink (0), and an ink line of shadow on the water
# under it. The anchor, 0,0, is its left end on the waterline. 18 wide,
# 4 tall.
C 10  L 0,-2 15,-2  L 0,-1 15,-1
C 14  L 1,-3 15,-3
C 0  L 16,-3  L 16,-2 17,-2  L 16,-1 17,-1  L 1,0 15,0
